# Ambient cloud

At 43:00 in his conversation about Alchemy, Sam describes an ambient cloud: accounts and credentials held behind one login and a cloud wallet. [Watch the moment](https://youtu.be/MtKHzAH6uXM?t=2580).

This note preserves Sam's framing from that conversation. See [Sam Goodwin on Alchemy](/lore/devtools-fm-sam-goodwin-alchemy).
